{"title":"Career roadmap — Payment Systems Analyst","role":"Payment Systems Analyst","summary":"A Payment Systems Analyst analyses and supports the technology, operations, data, risk, and performance of payment systems such as cards, bank transfers, instant payments, wallets, payment gateways, and merchant-processing platforms. The role combines payments domain knowledge + SQL/data analytics + APIs + transaction processing + risk/compliance + business analysis.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Business Analytics / FinTech"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate, this is a strong FinTech pathway because technical skills can be combined with an understanding of payment flows, reconciliation, settlement, transaction failures, fraud, and system performance."},{"type":"note","label":"Core principle","text":"A strong Payment Systems Analyst should be able to trace a transaction from customer → merchant → payment gateway → processor/network → bank → settlement, identify where it failed, quantify the impact, and communicate the solution clearly."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What to build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Payments Analyst / FinTech Analyst"},{"text":"Payments fundamentals, SQL, APIs, reconciliation, analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Senior Payment Systems Analyst"},{"text":"Payment architecture, risk, performance, integrations"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Payments Product/Technology Lead"},{"text":"Payment platforms, optimisation, incident management, strategy"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Payments Architect / FinTech Product Director"},{"text":"Global payment infrastructure, AI, fraud prevention, platform strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Yea