tems such as UPI, IMPS, NEFT, RTGS, cards, wallets and Aadhaar-enabled payment ecosystems, while remembering that specific operating rules and product details can change."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Payment analytics + systems"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Become highly comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Date/time analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse payment data"},{"type":"p","text":"Example dataset:"},{"type":"table","header":["Transaction","Amount","Method","Status","Time","Merchant"],"rows":[[{"text":"T001"},{"text":"₹1,200"},{"text":"UPI"},{"text":"Success"},{"text":"10:02"},{"text":"M001"}],[{"text":"T002"},{"text":"₹850"},{"text":"Card"},{"text":"Failed"},{"text":"10:04"},{"text":"M002"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Success rate"},{"text":"Failure rate"},{"text":"Decline rate"},{"text":"Transaction volume"},{"text":"Transaction value"},{"text":"Average transaction value"},{"text":"Failure reasons"},{"text":"Gateway performance"},{"text":"Merchant performance"},{"text":"Peak transaction periods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a major practical skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction records"},{"type":"p","text":"vs."},{"type":"h","text":"Gateway records"},{"type":"p","text":"vs."},{"type":"h","text":"Bank/processor records"},{"type":"p","text":"vs."},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement records"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing transactions"},{"text":"Duplicate transactions"},{"text":"Amount mismatches"},{"text":"Settlement delays"},{"text":"Refund mismatches"},{"text":"Failed settlements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"APIs and technical payments"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"HTTP"},{"text":"JSO