"},{"text":"Real-time data"},{"text":"Embedded financial services"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding API architecture + financial workflows will be valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Embedded payments"},{"type":"p","text":"Payments are increasingly built directly into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Travel"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Marketplaces"},{"text":"Enterprise software"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates demand for analysts who understand both product workflows and payment infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Cross-border payments"},{"type":"p","text":"Important future areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Currency conversion"},{"text":"FX"},{"text":"Settlement"},{"text":"Correspondent banking"},{"text":"International compliance"},{"text":"Payment routing"},{"text":"Transaction costs"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"The traditional model:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Analyse payment reports","investigate failures","prepare reports"]},{"type":"p","text":"will increasingly become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Real-time transaction monitoring","automated anomaly detection","predictive failure analysis","intelligent routing","automated reconciliation","continuous optimisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The highest-value professionals will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Payments","data","APIs","risk","product","AI."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment lifecycle"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Capture"},{"text":"Settlement"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"Chargebacks"},{"text":"Reversals"},{"text":"Payment failures"},{"text":"Reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Webhooks"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Idempotency"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"AML/KYC awareness"},{"text":"Risk scoring"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merchant operations"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Business requirements"},{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"KPI analysis"},{"text":"Financial metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incident management"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Problem solving"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["2026–27: Finance + SQL + Python + analytics","2027–28: Banking + payment lifecycle + APIs","2028–29: Reconciliation + payment analytics + risk","2029–30: FinTech/payment internship + payment-system projects","2030–32: Payment Systems Analyst","2032–35: Senior Payment Systems Analyst / Product Analyst","2035–40: Payments Product/Technology Lead","2040–46: Payments Architect / Head of Payments / FinTech Product Director"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA FinTech","advanced SQL","Python","Power BI","payment lifecycle knowledge","APIs/webhooks","reconciliation","fraud/risk fundamentals","strong analytical and business communication skills."],"sep":"+","label":"Best employability combination"}]}]}